    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lŏlĭum</span></b> , ii,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>darnel, cockle, tares</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 18,
				17, 44, § 153</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infelix lolium et steriles dominantur avenae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 154</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				E. 5, 37</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lolio victitare,</span>”
				<i>to have bad eyes</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 2, 3, 50</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et careant loliis oculos vitiantibus agri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					1, 691</span></i>
			.</div>
